<v Josh Johnson>[LAUGHTER]
<v Josh Johnson>[笑声]

00:37:01.240 --> 00:37:09.820
<v Josh Johnson>You know? Like, there was a year that my mom and I shared a bedroom when I was a little kid. What was she going to take away? The floor?
