<v Josh Johnson>[LAUGHTER]
<v Josh Johnson>[笑声]

00:38:50.840 --> 00:39:03.970
<v Josh Johnson>I feel like, no matter your-- no matter your feelings on spanking, we've all met-- we've all met, like, a grown man that deserved to have their ass beat.
