<v Josh Johnson>[LAUGHTER]
<v Josh Johnson>[笑声]

00:39:10.220 --> 00:39:17.510
<v Josh Johnson>And I think the thing for me-- the thing for me is that when-- could it have happened earlier?
<v Josh Johnson>而且我觉得对我来说——对我来说，难道不能早点发生吗？

00:39:17.510 --> 00:39:22.270
<v Josh Johnson>[LAUGHTER]
<v Josh Johnson>[笑声]

00:39:22.270 --> 00:39:38.660
<v Josh Johnson>And I want to be clear here. I'm not, like, blanketing, cosigning anything. I'm asking questions, genuinely. I'm asking questions, because people are very split on it. You know what I mean? But once again, we've all met a dude who, like-- damn.
<v Josh Johnson>我想明确一点。我不是在宽恕或认可任何事情。我只是真心在提问。我提问是因为人们对此分歧很大。你明白我的意思吗？但再一次，我们都见过一个家伙，像——该死。

