<v Josh Johnson>It would start on the sidewalk, and it spilled into the street. And basically, he's doing the hops, and he goes for a lunge. He goes for, like, this big punch, right? And when he goes for the big punch, the big dude moves out of the way and grabs his wrist. And they both look at it. They both look at it like-- he grabs his wrist and looks at it. And then he looks at it like, uh-oh. And--
<v Josh Johnson>它开始在人行道上，然后蔓延到了街上。基本上，他在弹跳，然后他准备冲刺。他准备打出重拳，对吧？当他冲过去准备重拳时，那个大块头移开了身子，抓住了他的手腕。他们两个都看着它。他们都看着它像——他抓住他的手腕看着它。然后他看着它像，呃哦。然后——

