<v Josh Johnson>[笑声]

00:42:55.390 --> 00:43:18.740
<v Josh Johnson>And then-- and then, he grabs his wrist, and with his other hand, he grabs the back of the dude's belt. Right? Pulls him forward, knocks the guy, pretty much, off balance, lets go of the wrist, passes the belt to his other hand, lifts him up, and then-- spanked him in public. And like--
<v Josh Johnson>然后——然后，他抓住他的手腕，用另一只手抓住那家伙的腰带。对吧？把他拽向前面，基本上让那家伙失去平衡，放开手腕，把腰带换到另一只手，把他提起来，然后——当众打他屁股。而且就像——

